<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka buys 12,500 T sugar at $336.90 per tonne.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka buys 12,500 T sugar at $336.90 per tonne.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka has bought 12,500 tonnes of white refined sugar from Gill &amp; Duffus S.A. Geneva at $336.90 per tonne, officials at the Co-operative Wholesale Establishment, the state buying arm, said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The sugar is for delivery between March 15 and April 5, they said.</p>
</text>
